  "text": " Noah looked at her, then took his pencil from behind his ear and wrote in the ledger on his desk's ledge in his narrow upright hand. Kiva watched him write. The 16th. A hair on all pens at 12.44 by the mast clock. Nobody on the mast. At Mallow Creek, by T7's Captain's Watch, a stow turned at 12.44 or 12.45. Seven minutes before the water. Rowan, fingers on a pole, the grass. NB. He did not draw a line between them. He did not write because. He left a space under it.",
